OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says he'll put country 'on
OL,4,Anew path' as he begins first Labour
OL,5,Aconference speech as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FPledging "honesty" and a "new path", he
OL,8,Fsays: "I will say it straight - Britain
OL,9,Fhas been on the wrong path for a long
OL,10,Ftime"
OL,12,FBurnham's speech comes as his party
OL,13,Fdebates the future of the "triple
OL,14,Flock", which means the state pension
OL,15,Fincreases by inflation, average wage
OL,16,Fgrowth, or 2.5% - whichever is highest
